            <ol>
                <li>Use the workbench in DEV/QA to stage, compare, preview and understand metadata changes.</li>
                <li>For intended release changes, capture the outcome in source-controlled schema SQL and metadata manifests.</li>
                <li>Keep environment-specific ignores or manual map overrides explicit and auditable; do not rely on silent manual LIVE database edits.</li>
                <li>Automated deployment remains: schema deploy / metadata validate / metadata apply.</li>
                <li>After changing EntityType metadata scope, restage and rebuild the identity map before creating the release artefacts.</li>
            </ol>
